   "title": "Swachh Survekshan awards: Mysuru to know its rank on Nov. 11",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/karnataka/swachh-survekshan-awards-mysuru-to-know-its-rank-on-nov-11/article71678207.ece",
