   "summary": "The country's finance minister said Friday that the financial authorities will map out measures to help the local stock market be less volatile amid the ongoing tech rout. In an economy-related meeting, Finance Minister Lee Hyoung-il said the U.S. midterm elections are an important watershed for the global economy, saying that overnight falls on Wall Street in the face of tighter regulations on AI-related sectors would deliver a blow to the global market.",
   "summary_zh": "该国财政部长周五表示，在科技股持续遭遇抛售之际，金融机构将制定措施，帮助本土股市降低波动。在一次 Economy 相关会议上，财政部长李炯逸表示，美国中期选举是全球经济的重要分水岭，并称，在人工智能相关行业监管收紧的情况下，华尔街隔夜下跌将冲击全球市场。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "The country's finance minister said Friday that the financial authorities will map out measures to help the local stock market be less volatile amid the ongoing tech rout. In an economy-related meeting, Finance Minister Lee Hyoung-il said the U.S. midterm elections are an important watershed for the global economy, saying that overnight falls on Wall Street in the face of tighter regulations on AI-related sectors would deliver a blow to the global market. Lee said the Korean economy's fundamentals are more solid than ever before and vowed to respond to external uncertainties. Shortly after the opening bell, trading of the KOSPI-listed shares was suspended for 20 minutes, as the benchmark index plunged by more than 8 percent amid tech sell-offs",
